{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今年3月剛正式出道、頂著「法律系大學生」學霸光環的日本AV女優，近日公開吐露不為人知的悲慘身世！</p><p>她透露自己童年曾遭到「有毒父母」（毒親）的不當對待，16歲時甚至被強制安置於兒少保護機構長達半年，直到18歲離家出走後才徹底與雙親切割斷絕關係。這段比AV劇本還曲折的暗黑過去曝光後，引發大批粉絲震驚與心疼。</p><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149489454780416784362.jpeg/UXVot4t4MtKzfm9hsabqBoWpVpBSUzDTGx0ieRsdInk\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><p>更多博多彩葉相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149302388690944928106.jpeg/x33zLo-3GxIPal1g8dq4SanrTKr-ASfIBKO9zwSjvc8\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149491669504000468520.jpeg/IA_j6MFBefuhfuC5Dj4u-2JjuNjdR721wSDdGMEg3Rg\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149492420284416475820.jpeg/CYkkG3nHy10h2oYCFdulXSKsvO3djVX-cAt0FHALdBQ\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149493942947840712504.jpeg/E1LoP7Om7JfdtdIIXyndHnb4cH5ZA_xrh4ErsIeBK7A\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149489899376640730254.jpeg/baDCrIPhJWmv0NP3drHJsyjCo3iERamaLeRi7i3kYu4\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149487298777088562043.jpeg/QGv-jSRb_FysRJGYH4CBAu-6SaRstuFS5wIlz-cCJc8\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149497466294272583096.jpeg/_5BzIPvsOqHn8QYdD957Et8NjvSDmMnej98YDo_fGA4\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185582078373138432805126.jpeg/t0GrQVmHq9YzjcaWjLlAtXOV1ySj-v9akUAyx5FAMsc\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149490419470336986173.jpeg/3dQqNp9DHkoPihly15ARFGW6Kkdh6g9IaezPUWnsz1E\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185582080856297472693021.jpeg/WOvqoJTefbf_4nFXgirKY3BZO3jyNfM2DJ_49gyf-PY\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149488297021440853609.jpeg/Ra3sc_UyDoGdSLDekZTVbsLiEz7L_FQmw5UZ7sOVGe4\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149486061457408685123.jpeg/7uS42tyoqB9y-tYJqcCP7eGiKg_JDMvwx4nzYMeJ82A\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260313/1109149495859875840547123.jpeg/cxBshIpU_7lJICWbAsfRReEAAUqa4ExLPU-8Xz1PvF8\"/><figcaption>博多彩葉（Instagram@iroha0108_）</figcaption></figure><p>16歲進保護機構「過生日像坐牢」！揭母親虐完她竟轉行當保母</p><p>知名AV達人一劍浣春秋在專欄撰文指出，博多彩葉日前讀到一篇探討「有毒父母」的文章產生強烈共鳴，因而勇敢揭開童年創傷。</p><p>博多彩葉坦言，16歲被送往兒少機構收容時，連生日都在裡面度過，當時感覺每分每秒都像在坐牢，完全失去自由與家庭溫暖。最讓她感慨諷刺的是，當年傷害她的母親，如今居然轉行擔任保母、每天照顧別人的小孩，讓她心中五味雜陳。</p><p>靠打工兼差咬牙考上法律系！自認起跑點不同痛恨命運不公</p><p>為了維持生計，博多彩葉當年被迫輟學並靠著不停打工賺取生活費，後來憑著頑強意志力邊工作邊取得同等學歷認證，最終順利考上法律系，成功靠自己翻轉人生。</p><p>提及入行契機，她坦言背負這種先天劣勢讓她非常痛苦，看著大家處於不同起跑線卻要套用相同規則競爭，心理相當不平衡，這也是她咬牙闖蕩娛樂圈的原因之一。</p><p>奉勸家庭美滿女孩「千萬別衝動入行」！背後辛酸引粉絲熱議</p><p>面對許多家庭生活美滿卻因好奇或衝動選擇入行的女孩，博多彩葉坦言實在無法理解，更以過來人身分特別勸告大家務必三思，切勿輕易踏入暗黑界。博多彩葉展現出超乎常人的韌性，也讓不少影迷為她的堅強頻頻加油打氣。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：AV女優倉木華輕生離世　好友揭暗黑內幕　遭男友多次毆打侵吞酬勞（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801669142188032978514.jpeg/08FhxxyQiWpCRbX6_QXE559wxshT0J0RdTDxi3Uw8Ys\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：AV女優倉木華輕生離世　好友揭暗黑內幕　遭男友多次毆打侵吞酬勞（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優倉木華驚傳過世，所屬經紀公司隨後也證實噩耗，並坦言對她生前遭受的痛苦感到無比憤怒。（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801664171675648590247.jpeg/bqJZgByQmNk59WglCo5MAudbdHiPfkyRviKAOb4igDk\"/><figcaption>AV女優倉木華驚傳過世，所屬經紀公司隨後也證實噩耗，並坦言對她生前遭受的痛苦感到無比憤怒。（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"而倉木華好友、同時也是前AV女優的日向真凜也在X（原Twitter）揭露倉木華生前長期被牛郎男友暴力對待，連酬勞都被榨乾，怒轟「我一輩子都不會原諒你！」（X@_mariiin_07）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260915/1176487242018328576398506.jpeg/mOjVjokr7bAMJ0joNQGgc8R7y0PEeBGQENWf6xDVn-s\"/><figcaption>而倉木華好友、同時也是前AV女優的日向真凜也在X（原Twitter）揭露倉木華生前長期被牛郎男友暴力對待，連酬勞都被榨乾，怒轟「我一輩子都不會原諒你！」（X@_mariiin_07）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日向真凜發文為倉木華發聲。（X@_mariiin_07）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260915/1176487236955541504478609.jpeg/OAQM5CPefDXC7k0f0G2RTKrpmQN4ZrSLtij4bbYo-G0\"/><figcaption>日向真凜發文為倉木華發聲。（X@_mariiin_07）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801666256375808851402.jpeg/1ghTz-IPrbJE9tELfbXGNtYC635ZYGV2Bi2IOQYtiDk\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801659465404416842673.jpeg/TkSl7Lv1HJ-9-nbVf3LmF7xXelojdg3iMxWiYDMVomA\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801664079400960285743.jpeg/8YePB2k22Jb-Lk7CxSXDaR_RjQmFQ72TNJJWETSSVhE\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175802128971599872231947.jpeg/I_Z9WpIVHNgxYOLOGntiF-CJcw3HT4z5VvY7IFb2OyA\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801660807712768279681.jpeg/QkKQHrjvrEOCupmnAfrpBUkNNT0jnY5cr_Oppq_zqaY\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801661764276224714250.jpeg/A4WBTHGpsqp4drLLyNKlnmellM_UFFD278bD0O_Gw9A\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801658265833472173206.jpeg/NXVKJouaxFL3vbqbWBWpPqrHuE_liZ3SEg52qhIOdqo\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175801655183020032853741.jpeg/ucMuY3hTAQlLSzzFpo68hdMelljAhMAuejgpdHo4KXQ\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優倉木華（IG@hana_kuraki87）</figcaption></figure><p>日「神顏女優」最新排名！河北彩花、瀨戶環奈竟都輸給她</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T14:18:36.880027+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1548,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}